## 7. Universal Material Schema (`ID 0..12`)

| ID | Material | Type | Density (`kg/L`) | Visc. | Elec. Cond. | Struct HP (0–15) & Tier | Thermal & Cellular Laws (Exact `4°C` Bytes) |
| :- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `0` | **AIR** | Empty | `0.00` | — | `0.0` | Permeable to all | Ambient `+20°C` (`55`). Required adjacent oxidizer for `OIL`/`WOOD` ignition; insulates `CRYO` from ambient air. |
| `1` | **WATER** | Fluid | `1.00` | `2` | `0.9` | Fluid | Freezes `1:1` to `ICE` (`<= 0°C` / `50`); boils `1:1` to `STEAM` (`>= +100°C` / `75`, Phase Explosion); pairwise douses `FIRE`; conducts heat & BFS voltage. |
| `2` | **OIL** | Fluid | `0.80` | `1` | `0.0` | Fluid (Floats on Water) | Slows entities (`0.6x`). Conducts heat. Ignites to `FIRE` (`+648°C`, `V_oil_combusted++`) at `>= +180°C` (`95`) **only with adjacent `AIR`**. |
| `3` | **CRYO** | Fluid | `1.10` | `3` | `0.0` | Fluid (Sinks below Water) | Base `-196°C` (`1`). **Excluded from generic conduction**; warms via: (1) `>= +100°C` contact -> instant Boil-Off Phase Explosion (`-> AIR`), (2) freezing `WATER -> ICE` (`+32°C`/freeze), (3) chilling entities/`WOOD_BARRIER` (`-12°C` target / `+4°C` cryo), (4) `1 Hz` `+4°C`/s warming next to non-`GLASS_VAT`, non-`CRYO`, non-`AIR` solids `{HULL_STEEL, STEEL_GRATE, ICE, WOOD_BARRIER}` (`~49 s` max floor lifetime; intact `CRYO` vats stay insulated indefinitely), (5) floating `0G` `CRYO` with no solid contact warms `+4°C` (`+1` byte) every `5.0 s` (`(simTick % 300) === 0`, `~4 min` max). Sublimates to `AIR` at `>= 0°C` (`50`). |
| `4` | **STEAM** | Gas | `0.10` | `3` | `0.0` | Gas (Passes Grates) | Spawns at `+100°C` (`75`), `45` ticks (`3.0 s` at 15 Hz). Rises `-dirY` (isotropic in `0G`), rising by swapping through liquids above it; condenses `1:1` to `WATER` at `min(tempByte, 70)` on timer `0` or solid `<= +80°C`. Not siphonable. |
| `5` | **FIRE** | Plasma | `0.05` | `1` | `0.0` | Plasma (Passes Grates) | Burns at `+648°C` (`212`), `30` ticks (`2.0 s` at 15 Hz). Explicitly rises `-dirY` through `AIR` and swaps up through `STEAM` (isotropic in `0G`); heats non-`FIRE` 6-neighbors `+32°C`/15 Hz tick **excluding `AIR`, `GLASS_VAT`, and `BOUNDARY_HULL`**; expires to `AIR` at timer `0`. Not siphonable. |
| `6` | **ICE** | Solid | `0.92` | — | `0.0` | **HP `4` (Tier 1 Brittle)** | Static solid (no buoyancy); participates in conductive-pair heat transfer (stable at `0°C` on `+20°C` steel/water since `|55-50| < 8` bytes). Melts `1:1` to `WATER` at **`>= +4°C` (`51`)**; shatters into `Ballistic(ICE)` on `damage >= 4` (Air Burst = `4`, Explosion = `8`, Impact `V_n > 7.5` = `4`). **Water-ledger phase: never a valid `ACID` carve target and never deleted by Debug Hotkeys.** If the ballistic pool is full at shatter time, the `ICE` cell stays on-grid with `damage = 3` and retries next tick. |
| `7` | **GLASS_VAT**| Solid | `2.50` | — | `0.0` | **HP `4` (Tier 1 Brittle)** | **Non-conductive thermal insulator** (`tempByte` fixed at init: **only `CRYO`-filled vats init at `-196°C`**; `WATER`/`OIL` vats & windows init at `+20°C`). Shatters to `AIR` on `damage >= 4` or thermal shock (`|T_source - T_glass| >= 140°C` strictly against `THERMAL_SHOCK_SOURCES = { WATER, OIL, CRYO, STEAM, FIRE, ACID }` or active Hazard Emitters—intentionally excluding `AIR`, static solids, and entities). |
| `8` | **WOOD_BARRIER**| Solid | `0.70` | — | `0.0` | **HP `12` (Tier 2)** | On reaching `>= +220°C` (`105`) + adjacent `AIR`, transitions `1:1` directly into `FIRE` (removing solid & invalidating its `1.0 m` nav-cell); takes struct dmg from Air Burst (`2`), Explosion (`6`), Wall-Splat (`6`), and Boss `ACID` (`+1`/15 Hz tick)—all **`3x` when `<= -48°C` (`38`)**. |
| `9` | **HULL_STEEL**| Solid | `7.80` | — | `1.0` | **HP `15` (Tier 3 Heavy)** | Interior decks, bulkheads & stairs. Conducts heat (`ΔT/8` conductive pairs) and BFS voltage; only exposed surface cells (or cells within `2` voxels of a heat/electric source) enter the `8,192` `activeThermalSolids` list; **carvable only by Boss `ACID` (max `+1` dmg/solid/15 Hz tick) or Debug Hotkeys (`1–6`)**. |
| `10`| **STEEL_GRATE**| Solid | `7.80` | — | `1.0` | **HP `15` (Selective-Permeable)** | Solid to AABB entities, ballistic `ICE` shards, and viscous `ACID` (which pools atop and carves it); **permeable to `WATER`, `OIL`, `CRYO`, `STEAM`, and `FIRE`**. Conducts heat and BFS voltage. |
| `11`| **ACID** | Fluid | `1.15` | `2` | `0.4` | Boss Bio-Fluid | Secreted exclusively by Brood Sovereign (`20 DPS` entity DOT). Pools atop `STEEL_GRATE`; each solid accepts **max `+1` `ACID` damage per `15 Hz` tick** (priority: **`+dirY`**—`-Y` in `1G/2G/3G`, `+Y` in `-1G`—then the 4 horizontals, then above); valid carve targets are `{HULL_STEEL, STEEL_GRATE, WOOD_BARRIER, GLASS_VAT}` (**`ICE` is water-ledger volume and `BOUNDARY_HULL` is immune, so neither can be carved**); the cell delivering the carving blow (max HP) removes the solid to `AIR` and is consumed (`-> AIR`, `V_acid_consumed++`). Conducts BFS voltage. Not siphonable. |
| `12`| **BOUNDARY_HULL** | Solid | `7.80` | — | `0.0` | **HP `∞` (Indestructible)** | Seals all 6 outer room perimeter faces; airlock doorways are stamped with `BOUNDARY_HULL` on room load. Electrically insulated, thermally non-conductive, and immune to Boss `ACID`, explosions, and Debug Hotkeys (`1–6`). |

