## 10. Incremental Micro-Milestone Execution Plan (Testable at Every Stage)
Each milestone must compile, pass its `node:test` invariant suite, and clear its **Playtest Gate** on the 8GB M1 MacBook Air before advancing:

### Phase 1: Clean v2 Core, Chunked `BatchedMesh` Renderer & Kinetic Controller
* **Milestone 1.1 — `balance.ts`, `node:test` Invariants, `240 x 64 x 240` Grid & `BatchedMesh` Cutaway Renderer:**
  * Mark `SPEC.md` `SUPERSEDED`, pin Node `>= 22.18` (or `tsx`) with `"test": "node --test"`, remove unused `@dimforge/rapier3d-compat` and `@tweenjs/tween.js`, pin stable Vite (`^6.x`/`^7.x`), and implement `src/core/balance.ts` + a `node:test` suite verifying chunk divisibility (`W,H,D % 16 === 0`), exact `4°C` thermal bytes, `15 L` burst divisibility across all tank ranks (`120/150/180/210 L` & `90/105/120/135 L`), zero-overflow Starter -> Baffled auto-split across ranks `0..3`, exact integer siphon rates (`2..5 L/tick`), `0G` loft height (`0.62–1.02 m`), catwalk/Floater/Boss clearances, `GRAV_CD_MIN === 2.5 > 0` (cooldown-on-end), and `DECK_ROOMS_MIN/MAX` (`10–14`) bounds.
  * Implement `src/core/types.ts` and `src/core/roomGen.ts` for the `240 x 64 x 240` Cargo Hold test room (sealed `BOUNDARY_HULL` (ID `12`) outer perimeter walls with `y=2..29` portal doorway + `2.0 m` alcove + `5`-step vestibule stairs, `y=0` `BOUNDARY_HULL` + `y=1..11` `HULL_STEEL` base, `8x8 m` sunken pit (`y=2..11` open above `y=0` `BOUNDARY_HULL` + `y=1` `HULL_STEEL` liner) with `5` walkable exit steps, `3.8 m` `STEEL_GRATE` catwalk with `2.4 m` below & above, `13`-step catwalk stairs, destructible `GLASS_VAT` & `WOOD_BARRIER` structures).
  * Build `src/viewer/scene3D.ts` with `3` `THREE.BatchedMesh` solid buckets (`<= 48 MB` cap with distance-prioritized LRU eviction, max `16` remeshes/frame), 15% translucent South/East upper bulkheads, fragment-shader sightline X-ray cutaway, directional shadow pass, and `F3` Debug Overlay (FPS, sim/render ms breakdown, draw calls, active chunk/voxel counts, debug-only carve hotkeys `1–6`).
  * Prototype `THREE.BatchedMesh.deleteGeometry()` under the `48 MB` LRU cap; if geometry-slot fragmentation prevents compaction, fall back to a fixed-slot chunk `BufferGeometry` pool with an explicit `.dispose()` free-list. Enable `sortObjects = true` on the Glass/Ice bucket and cap damage decals at `MAX_DAMAGE_DECALS = 512` (nearest to the player, rebuilt from `dirtyDecals` chunk flags).
  * *Playtest Gate:* Verify `60 FPS` (`<= 16.67 ms` total frame), `<= 6` scene render passes, instant real-time carving of greedy-meshed chunks via debug hotkeys, and clear sightlines above/below the `3.8 m` catwalk.

* **Milestone 1.2 — Fixed `60 Hz` Accumulator, `1G/0G/-1G` Controller, `upSign`/`feetY` & Swept AABB Physics:**
  * Implement the fixed `60 Hz` accumulator (`dt <= 0.05 s`), gyro-aligned humanoid rig (`0.6 x 1.6 x 0.6 m`, `90 kg` dry, `upSign` flipping boots `180°` to `+Y` in `-1G`), **baseline `C` (`2G`) and `V` (`-1G`) gravity pulses with no attachment prerequisite**, `WASD` + `0.2 m` stair step-up (pit, vestibule, and catwalk stairs), `0G` `E`/`Left-Shift` flight bounded naturally by floor/ceiling AABB collision, deck-relative Laser Plumb-Line cast from `feetY` along `plumbDir`, and swept AABB-vs-voxel collision with capped Wall-Splat damage (`0.25 s` i-frames).
  * *Playtest Gate:* Walk out of the `1.0 m` sunken pit via its `5` steps, run up the `13`-step stairs to the `3.8 m` catwalk in `1G`, toggle `0G` (`Q`) to hover cleanly below/above the catwalk with the plumb-line ring tracking pit/deck/catwalk surfaces, test baseline `-1G` (`V`, `3.5 s`) ceiling boots flip + early `Q` cancel + post-end `GRAV_CD`, and verify `1G` drop impact detection.

* **Milestone 1.3 — Brittle Vats, Dynamic AABB Crates, Base Alien Dummy, `12 m` LOS Lock-On & Air Nozzle:**
  * Add movable AABB `WOOD_CRATE` bodies (`60 kg`, `60 HP`, `<= 16`/room, despawning at `0 HP`), brittle `GLASS_VAT` shells (`HP 4`), and the **Base Alien Target Dummy** (full canonical `Entity` schema, `100 HP`, `80 kg` dry), with entity-entity swept AABB collision (`100%` target / `50%` striker recoil).
  * Implement `12.0 m` 3D DDA LOS Magnetic Lock-On (Enemies, `WOOD_CRATE`, `GLASS_VAT`, `0G` `>= 20 L` clusters), `Left-Click` hitscan Compressed Air Bursts (hitting all targets in the `8.0 m`, `25°` cone with nominal `960 kg·m/s` impulse and independent clamped `deltaV ∈ [2.5, 14.0]` per target, `4` Tier-1 / `2` Tier-2 struct dmg, `-2.5 m/s` 0G recoil), and `Space` `14 m/s` Jetpack Dash (`0.4 s`, self wall-splat immune).
  * *Playtest Gate:* Lock onto the Alien Dummy and crates through glass (verifying steel blocks lock-on), punt crates into the dummy for capped entity-entity Wall-Splat damage, shatter greedy-meshed `GLASS_VAT` walls with Air Bursts, and slam airborne targets from `0G` to `1G`.

### Phase 2: 10 cm Cellular Automata, Swept-DDA Ballistics & Elemental Reactions
* **Milestone 2.1 — Bitset Active-Cell Fluid CA (`1G/0G/-1G/2G/3G`), Swept-DDA Ballistics & 4-Float Instancing:**
  * Implement the `16,384` bitset-deduplicated active-cell list, `steppedThisPass` post-pass clear, separate `fluidOverflowCursor` / `thermalOverflowCursor` scanners (`<= 2` oldest chunks/tick each), `hash32` deterministic PRNG (including deterministic non-`AIR` `shimmer`), `4,096` SoA `ballisticQuanta` pool, total `placeOrDeferFluid()` + fixed-entry `deferredFluidQueue` (`MAX_DEFERRED_FLUID = 4,096`, current-entity-AABB rechecks, clean tank-siphon block when full, `deathHusk` fallback for saturated gland bursts, airlock serialization fallback), swept 3D DDA target-cell merge/spread, `0G` lift (`2.2–3.4 m/s`, `0.95` drag, `< 0.35 m/s` auto-reinsert -> `0.62–1.02 m` loft), and full `60 Hz` gravity-aware CA (Rule 1A liquids + liquid-into-`STEAM`/`FIRE` swaps, Rule 1B gas upward buoyancy incl. `FIRE` through `STEAM` and `STEAM` through liquids, `1G/2G/3G/-1G` sub-passes, `STEEL_GRATE` drainage, Archimedes swaps, shoreline cohesion using the canonical `N_same`, `0G` surface-tension spheres). Add a `node:test` `N_same` invariant (`3x3` puddle + droplet merge), source/destination `markCellDirty()`/`markFluidRenderDirty()` assertions, **zero-deletion tests under a full ballistic pool + full deferred queue**, and a **room-load active-list re-seed test** proving saved exposed/submerged fluid/gas and hot solids simulate without a manual poke while sealed, fully filled vat interiors stay asleep.
  * Implement the **Persistent Shared-Pool Fluid Render Cache** (`fluidCachePool: Float32Array(24,576 * 4)` = `393 KB`, `chunkFluidOffset` / `chunkFluidCount` / `dirtyFluidRender`, `markFluidRenderDirty()` triggers, `MAX_FLUID_CACHE_REBUILDS_PER_FRAME = 16` / `8` fallback, 6-face same-fluid interior culling) rendering up to `28,672` opaque/alpha-tested rim-tinted fluid instances (`24,576` visible grid + `4,096` ballistic) via the NaN-safe 4-float `(x, y, z, paletteIndex)` pass so sleeping puddles remain rendered at **`0` simulation CPU and `0` cache-rebuild CPU** (the per-frame copy is `O(visible <= 28,672)`). Pre-fill `4` `GLASS_VAT` shells in the room (**`2 WATER`, `1 OIL`, `1 CRYO` @ `2,500 L` each = `10,000 L`**, spaced `>= 3.0 m` apart).
  * *Playtest Gate:* Shatter all `4` vats (`10,000 L` total fluid) and stress-test up to the full `28,672` combined instance cap; verify sleeping puddles stay rendered, flood waves drain through the `STEEL_GRATE` catwalk and into the `1.0 m` pit with **100% conserved integer volume on the `F3` Debug Overlay**, loft `0.62–1.02 m` and curl into spheres in `0G`, and slam radially in `1G / 2G / 3G` at `60 FPS` (recording an M1 browser benchmark artifact and verifying rendering-only fallback degradation without replay divergence).

* **Milestone 2.2 — `transitionCell()`, Pairwise Conduction, `1 Hz` Relaxation, Capped BFS Electricity & Emitters:**
  * Implement Stages 5–7 of the tick pipeline: `transitionCell()`, `activeThermalSolids` (`8,192`; only exposed surface conductors or cells within `2` voxels of a heat/electric source, player-distance prioritized), `15 Hz` symmetric 6-neighbor conductive-pair conduction (`ΔT/8` with active-boundary waking for `{HULL_STEEL, STEEL_GRATE, WATER, OIL, ICE}` pairs), `1 Hz` ambient relaxation, pairwise `WATER+FIRE` dousing (`stage5Touched` bit-22 cleanup), Stage 5(c.5) **Electrical Spark Ignition** (`chargeUnits >= 20` igniting adjacent `OIL` + `AIR`), `CRYO`'s **5** finite thermal paths (instant `>= +100°C` Boil-Off, `+32°C` water-freeze, `-12°C/+4°C` wood/entity chill, `1 Hz` `+4°C`/s solid-floor warming, floating `0G` `+1` byte every `5.0 s` -> `>= 0°C` sublimation), `GLASS_VAT` thermal shock (`|ΔT| >= 140°C` against `THERMAL_SHOCK_SOURCES` + emitters only), `STEAM` condensation at `min(tempByte, 70)`, `ICE` `0°C`/`+4°C` hysteresis & `Ballistic(ICE)` shatters (pool-full leaves `damage = 3` and retries), bounded coalesced Phase Explosions (queue cap `32` with excess dropped as gameplay events and merged only as cosmetic intensity into the nearest queued wave, `26` deterministic rays deduped by solid `idx`, entity LOS blocked by `HULL_STEEL`/`BOUNDARY_HULL`/`WOOD_BARRIER`/`GLASS_VAT`/`ICE`, `20` dmg & `720 kg·m/s` nom. clamped falloff, `8` Tier-1 / `6` Tier-2 / `0` Tier-3 per unique hit cell), the shared structural damage resolver (every hit marks `dirtySnapshot`/`dirtyDecals`; `damage >= Struct HP` -> `ICE` shatter / `GLASS_VAT` shatter / wood/steel carve to `AIR`, with `dirtySolidMesh` + nav invalidation), and fair round-robin `2,048` global BFS electrical pulses.
  * Add `node:test` tuning invariants for `ΔT/8` (a `0°C` `ICE` cell stays stable on `+20°C` steel at `|55 - 50| = 5 < 8` and melts adjacent to `>= +32°C` conductors), explosion/air-burst `idx` deduplication (one unique solid cell takes one tier hit per wave/burst), **`ACID` never carving `ICE` or `BOUNDARY_HULL`**, and the **Cryo ledger including the `500 L` `Emitter(CRYO)` reserve**.
  * Place three **Environmental Hazard Emitters**: *Sparking Conduit* (`+120 V` every `0.5 s`), *Thermal Steam Vent* (`+300°C` heat injection; it does not create water-ledger volume), and *Leaking Cryo Pipe* (`-196°C`, finite `500 L` `Emitter(CRYO)` reserve counted in `V_cryo_total`).
  * *Playtest Gate:* Trigger multi-vat elemental chain reactions (oil burning on electrified water, cryo freezing waterfalls into shatterable `ICE` bridges shattering to `Ballistic(ICE)`, frozen `WOOD_BARRIER` breaking at `3x` structural damage, steam condensing back into rain), passing (1) headless `node:test` Water/Oil/Cryo ledger invariance tests (including the Cryo Pipe reserve) and (2) locked `60 FPS` in the browser.

### Phase 3: The Alchemist Suit Loop (Atomic Siphon, Tank Volatility & Attachments)
* **Milestone 3.1 — Starter Tank, Atomic Siphon (`2 + rank` L/tick), Fluid Nozzle & Plumbed Jetpack:**
  * Implement `WorldState.playerTank` (`120 + 30 * rank` L, `effectiveMassKg` coupling), atomic `Right-Click` Siphon (`6.0 m`, `35°` LOS cone, `2 + rank` L/tick with cap & source guard and cosmetic viewer stream), loaded `Left-Click` (`15 L` 3-shot burst at `4`-tick / `0.067 s` spacing, ticks `0/4/8` with `min(5, liters)` partial shots / `60 L/s` hose), plumbed `Space` dash (`24 L` over `0.4 s` / `1 L/tick`), and minimal HTML corner HUD.
  * *Playtest Gate:* Siphon `120 L` of `OIL` from a broken vat with exact `F3` ledger parity, jetpack-dash in `0G` over the Alien Dummy to lay a `24 L` floating oil ribbon into the Thermal Vent, and watch cellular fire propagate across the trail.

* **Milestone 3.2 — Unbaffled Volatility Matrix, Baffled Dual-Chamber Tank (`2 x (90 + 15*rank) L`) & Suit Attachments:**
  * Implement expanding-BFS grid-conserved displacement spills, air-headspace **Tank Backfire** (`25` self-dmg + expanding-BFS spill with queue-full chamber-lock retry), the inert-pressurized **Baffled Dual-Chamber Tank** (with rank-scaled zero-overflow auto-split verified by `node:test`) + `R` Proportioning Valve (active chamber for siphon, nozzle, and jetpack), and all `6` suit attachments (*Spark-Plug Igniter*, *Piezo-Arc Coil*, *Cryo-Expansion Nozzle*, *`3G` Overdrive* upgrading the baseline `C` pulse, *Gyro Stabilizer*, *Ablative Plating*), all toggleable via the `F3` Debug Overlay for Milestone 3.2 playtesting (offered via seeded Workbench terminals in normal runs).
  * *Playtest Gate:* Trigger a starter tank backfire with hot fluid (verifying all fluid stays conserved on the `F3` ledger), verify rank-3 `210 L` starter auto-splits into `135 L` (Chamber A) + `75 L` (Chamber B) inside the `2 x 135 L` Baffled Tank with zero overflow, and test self-igniting `OIL` dashes, self-electrified `WATER` streams, on-demand `ICE` walls, and `C`/`V` gravity pulses with early `Q` cancel.

### Phase 4: Procedural Xenomorphs, Lossless RLE Rooms & Boss Sanctum Loop
* **Milestone 4.1 — Procedural Aliens (`3 x 5 x 3`), `3`-Layer A* Nav-Grid, Telegraphed Attacks & Bio-Siphoning:**
  * Implement the `3`-layer `1.0 m` (`1,728`-node) A* nav-grid (`<= 12` active aliens/room, invalidated on any solid carve/place, progressive room-variant table), Skitterer (`60 HP`, `18 L`), Floater (`50 HP`, `24 L`, hovering clamped to `[localSurfaceY + 0.4, min(localSurfaceY + 0.9, localCeilingY - 1.55)]`, mirrored to the ceiling in `-1G`), and Crusher (`140 HP`, `48 L`) AI, telegraphed gland volleys (Skitterer `6 L`, Floater/Crusher `12 L`) with universal partial/depleted fallback, biological siphoning (`< 50%` HP or stunned), death gland bursts with the **`deathHusk` queue-full fallback** (payload retained in the alien's slot until placement succeeds), and all 3 carapaces (*Thermal Shell*, *Insulated Hide*, *Spined Exoskeleton*).
  * *Playtest Gate:* Use a Debug Wave Spawner to cycle through every archetype/gland/carapace permutation and verify elemental counterplay (e.g., siphoning `-196°C` `CRYO` from a stunned Cryo-Spitter to chill a Thermal Shell Crusher to `-48°C` and shatter it with a `3.0x` crate slam).

* **Milestone 4.2 — Graph-Grammar Deck (`10–14` Rooms), Lossless `32 MB` RLE Airlocks & Brood Sovereign Boss:**
  * Implement the abstract Graph-Grammar Deck Generator (`1` Arrival Airlock + `6–8` combat rooms + `2–4` optional side-rooms + `1` Boss Sanctum, `degree <= 4`, verified by `node:test`), Room 1 diegetic onboarding (empty starter tank, non-electrified cracked `WATER` vat, separate sparking conduit `2.0 m` away), Room-Load Reset Contract (**static once-per-load airlock seals, deterministic unlock rules, `45 s` off-nav teleport / `60 s` force-unlock failsafe**, plus full overflow/cache reset and fluid/gas + thermal re-seeding), in-world Workbench alcoves with `4` reusable upgrade terminals (`F`, inside every 3rd critical-path combat room; Patch `1`/alcove, Alcove 1 (Combat Room 3) caps non-patch purchases at `4`, Alcove 2 (Combat Room 6) allows unlimited refreshes) with full Salvage Scrap economy (`4.0 m` omni-directional auto-magnet within the current discrete room), zero-delta `dirtySnapshot` RLE persistence (`0xFC3FFFFF` preserving `slideDir` + `damage`, `32 MB` post-compression RAM cap via deflate/`IndexedDB` spill—best-effort if blocked—with `simPaused = true` during `0.35 s` airlock cycles), and the **Brood Sovereign (`450 HP`, `350 kg` dry / `~570 kg` full, `2.4 x 2.2 x 2.4 m`, `3 x 72 L` `CRYO`/`OIL`/`ACID` glands, `8.0 s` stun immunity with Boss-specific `1.5 s` electric stun override, Phase 1 `CRYO`/`PYRO` + Phase 2 `ACID` steel-carving barrages & stomp, Boss Sanctum Layer-2 grates excluded from Boss nav-grid, plus Boss Victory extraction banner)**.
  * Add a `node:test` **`dirtySnapshot` completeness audit**: random sequences of Stage 4 moves, siphon extraction, tank/backfire spills, emitter injection, timer/charge decay, structural damage, `ACID` carving, and ballistic/deferred placement must mark every modified chunk; encode -> clear -> re-load -> re-encode must reproduce bit-identical persisted bits (excluding transient bit `22` and regenerated `shimmer`).
  * **Audio & Accessibility:** WebAudio procedural SFX (no asset streaming), a colorblind-safe fluid palette, full key remapping, and a reduced-motion toggle (camera shake, impulse wobble, and cosmetic ribbon detail).
  * *Playtest Gate:* Complete a full 5–8 minute multi-room run from Arrival Airlock to Boss defeat, verifying seamless backtracking with 100% conserved carved walls/puddles, `< 350 MB` total tab memory, and locked `60 FPS`.
